y, Botany, Anthropology, Biology, Human Biology, Life Science, Biotechnology, Molecular Biology, or Forensic Science with Zoology/Botany as a subject in all three years of Bachelor’s degree,&nbsp;<strong>OR</strong>&nbsp;B.E./B.Tech in Biotechnology.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Scientific Assistant (Ballistics)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s Degree in Physics, Mathematics, Applied Mathematics, or Forensic Science with Physics/Mathematics as a subject in Bachelor’s degree.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Scientific Assistant (Chemistry)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s Degree in Chemistry, Toxicology, Biochemistry, or Forensic Science with Chemistry as a subject in Bachelor’s degree.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Scientific Assistant (Lie Detection)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s Degree in Psychology or Criminology.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Scientific Assistant (Documents)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s Degree in Physics or Chemistry, or B.Sc. with Physics/Chemistry studied for at least two years/four semesters.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Scientific Assistant (HRD/QC)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s Degree in Physics or Mathematics or Computer Science or Chemistry or Biology or Zoology or Forensic Science or Psychology or Toxicology or Biotechnology, or MCA,&nbsp;<strong>OR</strong>&nbsp;B.Tech in Computer Science/IT/ECE/Instrumentation.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\" width=\"21%\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Scientific Assistant (Photo)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s Degree in Physics, Computer Science, Data Analytics, Artificial Intelligence, Information Technology, or Forensic Science,&nbsp;<strong>OR</strong>&nbsp;B.Tech in AI/IT.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Scientific Assistant (Cyber Forensics)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s Degree in Computer Science, Computer Applications, IT, Physics with specialization in Electronics/Cyber Security,&nbsp;<strong>OR</strong>&nbsp;B.E./B.Tech in CS, IT, ECE, or Electrical &amp; Electronics Engineering.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Scientific Assistant (Crime Scene/District Mobile</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Forensic Unit)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s Degree in Zoology, Botany, Anthropology, Microbiology, Chemistry, Physics, Toxicology, Biochemistry, or Forensic Science.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Scientific Assistant (Finger Print)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s Degree in Physics, Chemistry, or Forensic Science, or B.Sc. with Physics/Chemistry studied for at least two years/four semesters.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Scientific Assistant (Physics)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s Degree in Physics or Forensic Science with Physics as a subject in Bachelor’s degree.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Technical Assistant (Hindi)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s Degree in Hindi/English or equivalent combinations of Hindi and English, plus Diploma/Certificate in Translation or relevant translation experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Archivist Grade-I</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s Degree in History with specialization in Modern Indian History and Diploma in Archives &amp; Records Management.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">I.T. Assistant Grade-A</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">12th Pass and typing speed of 8,000 key depressions per hour for data entry work.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Fitter Grade-II</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ITI Certificate in Plumber Trade and one year practical experience in water distribution network/C.I. &amp; G.I. pipes and accessories.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Lift Operator</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Matriculation and ITI Certificate in Electrician/Wireman Trade.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Operator-cum-Mechanic (A/C)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">12th with Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics, plus ITI in Refrigeration &amp; Air Conditioning.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Sub Station Operator</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Matriculation and National Trade Certificate/ITI in Electrician Trade.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Data Processing Assistant Grade A</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Degree from a recognized university, or Diploma/Degree in Computer Engineering, along with typing speed of 8,000 key depressions per hour.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Data Entry Operator Grade-B</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Degree from a recognized university, or 3-year Diploma in Computer Engineering/Digital Electronics/Electronics &amp; Communication Engineering<a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkaridisha.com/upsssc-pollution-control-board-admit-card/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">,</a>&nbsp;with typing speed of 8,000 key depressions per hour.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Trained Graduate Teacher (Computer Science)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">BCA, Graduation in Computer Science, B.E./B.Tech (Computer Science/IT), or Graduation with DOEACC ‘A’ Level.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Domestic Science Teacher</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelor’s Degree in Domestic Science/Home Science and B.Ed. with Domestic Science/Home Science.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Trained Graduate Teacher (Special Education Teacher)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Graduation with B.Ed. (Special Education) or equivalent Special Education qualifications and CTET qualification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Special Educator (Primary)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Class 12th with D.Ed. Special Education or equivalent RCI-recognized qualification and CTET (Primary Stage).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.0369%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Electrical Overseer / Sub-Inspector</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.9631%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Three-year Diploma or Degree in Electrical Engineering with relevant practical experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>DSSSB Various Posts Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the DSSSB before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other &nbsp;Notification Here – </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for DSSSB Various Posts recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>DSSSB Various Posts Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam/CBT</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Skill Test/ Typing Test / Computer Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000